{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-practice-44","level":"A2","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Wie ist er? Wie ist es?","bn":"সে কেমন? এটা কেমন?"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Unser Wohnzimmer ist ___. (আরামদায়ক)","answers":["gemütlich"],"options":["gemütlich","streng","ängstlich"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der Lehrer ist ___. (কঠোর)","answers":["streng"],"options":["streng","gemütlich","neugierig"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das Kind ist ___ und fragt viel. (কৌতূহলী)","answers":["neugierig"],"options":["neugierig","ängstlich","stolz"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Bitte seien Sie ___. (ভদ্র)","answers":["höflich"],"options":["höflich","streng","schrecklich"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die Antwort ist ___. (লিখিত)","answers":["schriftlich"],"options":["schriftlich","mündlich","monatlich"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich bin ___ auf meine Tochter. (গর্বিত)","answers":["stolz"],"options":["stolz","neugierig","ängstlich"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das Wetter ist ___. (ভয়ানক)","answers":["schrecklich"],"options":["schrecklich","gemütlich","höflich"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der Arzt untersucht mich ___. (পুঙ্খানুপুঙ্খভাবে)","answers":["gründlich"],"options":["gründlich","häufig","mündlich"],"promptBn":"বিশেষণ","id":"a2-practice-44-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Es regnet. ___ gehe ich zur Arbeit. (তবুও)","answers":["Trotzdem"],"options":["Trotzdem","Deshalb","Weil"],"promptBn":"তবুও","id":"a2-practice-44-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich esse etwas, ___ ich ins Kino gehe. (আগে)","answers":["bevor"],"options":["bevor","nachdem","trotzdem"],"promptBn":"আগে","id":"a2-practice-44-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Nachdem ich gegessen ___, lerne ich.","answers":["habe"],"options